@* 2026-10-17: moved onto FeatureDemoLayout (row 8 of the Data Grid list) and made to match its menu label. The old page bound
   ExpandoObject rows to five fixed columns and dressed that as a "modal opening benchmark" with typed-in numbers (SC-022, SC-159,
   SC-160, SC-162); all of that went, with the "PickList"/"FPickList"/"HomeFront" names (SC-161) and the unused @ref (SC-163). Now
   the columns are read from the keys of the first row, a switch adds a field to every row so a column appears, and the row count
